        <item>
            <title>2.7.4</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 01:53:19 +0300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>64</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.7.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Changes

- The Dashboard is now just your calls: the Overview numbers and the calls-by-app list moved to Settings, in a new Statistics section.
- Import…, Open Ahoy Folder and Re-export all moved into the Dashboard's new Other menu. You can still import by dropping audio files on the window or with Open With in Finder.
- The period list shows in narrower windows too, now that the Dashboard has more room.
- If you start scrolling while a period jump is still settling, the feed no longer snaps back to that period's heading.
- The Statistics numbers update right away after you change how long audio is kept.
]]></description>
